  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資訊安全管理",
    "sub_ename": "INFORMATION SECURITY MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹資訊安全的管理標準、資訊與其風險、資訊安全管理系統的開發與維護、資產和風險管理、人力資源管理、實體環境安全管理、通訊與作業管理、資訊安全事故管理、營運持續管理、內部稽核與管理審查。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces information security's management standards, information and its risks, information security management system's development and maintenance, asset and risk management, human resources management, actual environment security management, communication and operation management, information security incidents management, continual operation management, and internal auditing and management inspection.",
